{"3187000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Randy The Racoon", "steam_appid": 3187000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cartoony Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bunch of cartoony weapons and a squishy car this game feels like it comes straight out of Looney Tunes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Raccoon with Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one taking enjoyment out of running over humans, Randy will be laughing right alongside you. Crash into a wall? He'll let you hear it. Don't let him sit idle too long either, you don't want to hear him sing. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=790 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Vibrant, Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling island filled with colorful NPCs to meet and missions to complete. From sassy animals to the infamous goose gang, there's something around every corner. Find out all the secrets hiding across the island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car you drive around in isn't just a boring driving car, it's got tons of fun features! Don't just drive around, use your rocket engine to fly around, use your jump to...well jump. Let's just say you're not stuck to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of crazy weapons like a balloon gun, stink tornados &amp; a radio that attracts humans like mosquitos to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of humans walking to test your weapons on or just hit &amp; run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny animals to talk to and accept missions from like Crazy Coq, Chip the Mechanic, a Cult Leader Capybara &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive map, the map has been filled with interaction such as cliffs with a certain weight limit, a big catapult, snowballs you can roll to grow, and more. In combination with your weapons you can create any situation to torture NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storyline, take down goose gang who have terrorized the island since you left.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Challenges, aside from the main storyline there's side challenges for you to complete &amp; cosmetics to unlock. Test your skills in these challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles, there's trash bags spread around the island, collect them all &amp; unlock a surprise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cartoony Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bunch of cartoony weapons and a squishy car this game feels like it comes straight out of Looney Tunes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/53541446620b0b0985370f30f7c36572.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Raccoon with Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one taking enjoyment out of running over humans, Randy will be laughing right alongside you. Crash into a wall? He'll let you hear it. Don't let him sit idle too long either, you don't want to hear him sing. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=790 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Vibrant, Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling island filled with colorful NPCs to meet and missions to complete. From sassy animals to the infamous goose gang, there's something around every corner. Find out all the secrets hiding across the island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/7b4fc7f7fbf4a6cb9e25bd93e552d27c.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car you drive around in isn't just a boring driving car, it's got tons of fun features! Don't just drive around, use your rocket engine to fly around, use your jump to...well jump. Let's just say you're not stuck to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.poster.avif?t=1768596123\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.webm?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.mp4?t=1768596123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of crazy weapons like a balloon gun, stink tornados &amp; a radio that attracts humans like mosquitos to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of humans walking to test your weapons on or just hit &amp; run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny animals to talk to and accept missions from like Crazy Coq, Chip the Mechanic, a Cult Leader Capybara &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive map, the map has been filled with interaction such as cliffs with a certain weight limit, a big catapult, snowballs you can roll to grow, and more. In combination with your weapons you can create any situation to torture NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storyline, take down goose gang who have terrorized the island since you left.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Challenges, aside from the main storyline there's side challenges for you to complete &amp; cosmetics to unlock. Test your skills in these challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles, there's trash bags spread around the island, collect them all &amp; unlock a surprise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Use cartoony weapons, run over humans, take down the Goose Mafia that wants you dead, drop giant snowballs into crowds, fly your stunt car across a packed island. Do whatever you want in this Simpsons Hit &amp; Run-inspired open world-sandbox!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/534de4f67840e23d39a4ca57665eba9ed1874a51/header.jpg?t=1768596123", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/f7cbdeca2b0cc8c3761eb446c9c55322adab8d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768596123", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/f7cbdeca2b0cc8c3761eb446c9c55322adab8d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768596123", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-760<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650/ Radeon HD 7510<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I7 12700H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb